nts out  Ellie and Andy like most families who've  been reunited the two will have to wait  for their Asylum case to be heard by a  judge and they still face the risk of  deportation there's also a large number  of families or parents that the  government has determined are ineligible  to be reunited the city is expecting to  receive about 300 families these  separated families are coming through  here but they will not stay for very  long the goal of these organizations is  to get them out on a plane and to their  final destination in less than 24 hours  Nora all right Maria thank you
 

